            <ArticleTitle>The use of Atrauman non-adherent wound dressing in tissue viability.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S29-30, S32-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This product focus considers the characteristics and application of Atrauman, a non-adherent dressing, in relation to the different aspects of wound healing. Atrauman has many characteristics that make it an ideal dressing choice in a number of clinical scenarios, including: pain free removal; promotion of healthy granulation tissue; cost effectiveness and versatility.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
